. do example.do

. * nwcommands tutorial 12: homophily, assortativity and mixing
. * Requires the core nwcommands.
. nwwebuse glasgow, nwclear

. nwsummarize glasgow1
--------------------------------------------------
   Network name:  glasgow1
   Network id:  1
   Directed: true
   Valued: false
   Two-mode: false
   Nodes: 50
   Selfloop: false
   Arcs: 113
   Minimum value:  0
   Maximum value:  1
   Density:  .0461
   Temporal: false

. summarize sport1 smoke1 alcohol1

    Variable |        Obs        Mean    Std. dev.       Min        Max
-------------+---------------------------------------------------------
      sport1 |         50        1.74    .4430875          1          2
      smoke1 |         50        1.38     .725343          1          3
    alcohol1 |         50        2.88    1.118308          1          5

. 
. * 1. Assortativity: correlate a number across ties
. nwassortativity glasgow1

  Network name: glasgow1
  Attribute: degree
----------------------------------------
    Ties: 74
    Assortativity coefficient: .172

. nwassortativity glasgow1, attribute(alcohol1)

  Network name: glasgow1
  Attribute: alcohol1
----------------------------------------
    Ties: 74
    Assortativity coefficient: .323

. nwassortativity glasgow1, attribute(sport1)

  Network name: glasgow1
  Attribute: sport1
----------------------------------------
    Ties: 74
    Assortativity coefficient: .069

. 
. * 2. Mixing tables for a categorical attribute
. nwmixing glasgow1, attribute(sport1) permutations(500)

   Network:  glasgow1      Directed: true
   Attribute:  sport1

 sport1_ego | sport1_alter
            | not regular     regular        Total
------------+-------------------------------------
not regular |          13          17           30
regular     |          21          62           83
------------+-------------------------------------
Total       |          34          79          113

   E-I Index: -.327   p-value: .348

. nwmixing glasgow1, attribute(smoke1) permutations(500)

   Network:  glasgow1      Directed: true
   Attribute:  smoke1

 smoke1_ego | smoke1_alter
            |         non occassional     regular        Total
------------+-------------------------------------------------
non         |          71           5          11           87
occassional |           5           2           4           11
regular     |           7           5           3           15
------------+-------------------------------------------------
Total       |          83          12          18          113

   E-I Index: -.345   p-value: .22

